# Seize Opportunity's first mode exiles exactly the top two cards of Bot1's library (the Forest and Mox Sapphire - the Island under
# them stays, and Bot2's library is not touched) and both may be played on Bot1's next turn: the land as its land drop, the Mox
# cast from exile. Cast at instant speed in Bot2's turn.

